WEBVTT

1
01:05:30.326 --> 01:05:36.304
Swadishthan, Thinking, Illness Part 2, Sydney, Australia, 19900316

2
01:05:36.505 --> 01:05:41.044
I bow to all the seekers of truth.

3
01:05:53.143 --> 01:05:57.550
I’m happy you all are enjoying this music and this dancing,

4
01:05:57.750 --> 01:06:03.300
and about these artists, I have to say that after coming to Sahaja Yoga,

5
01:06:03.500 --> 01:06:07.180
at a very young age, they achieved such mastery.

6
01:06:07.380 --> 01:06:11.417
Because, when the Kundalini rises, as I told you,

7
01:06:11.618 --> 01:06:15.998
She enriches your centres.

8
01:06:16.204 --> 01:06:26.488
The centre about which I was going to talk to you today is the centre of creativity,

9
01:06:26.689 --> 01:06:41.823
which looks after your power of action, physical and mental.

10
01:06:42.023 --> 01:06:50.177
This power of action moves on the right side of the spinal cord

11
01:06:50.377 --> 01:06:53.783
and coming to the optic chiasma, it crosses over,

12
01:06:54.003 --> 01:07:01.636
passes to the left side and creates an institution called ego.

13
01:07:04.357 --> 01:07:10.497
The institution of ego is a myth.

14
01:07:12.197 --> 01:07:17.557
What we do is to get something dead, like some trees dead,

15
01:07:17.757 --> 01:07:22.210
so make some platform or some furniture.

16
01:07:22.410 --> 01:07:26.237
We take some stones and make a hall,

17
01:07:26.437 --> 01:07:29.570
and we think we have done a great job.

18
01:07:29.770 --> 01:07:35.010
Actually, what we have done is to reconstructed the dead.

19
01:07:35.210 --> 01:07:40.257
But while doing it, we get the feeling that we have done it, something.

20
01:07:40.457 --> 01:07:45.516
That is how our ego develops.

21
01:07:47.469 --> 01:07:54.763
This channel on the right-hand side caters to your future.

22
01:07:56.037 --> 01:08:03.130
So those people who plan too much, think too much,

23
01:08:03.330 --> 01:08:06.830
exhaust the energy of this centre

24
01:08:07.030 --> 01:08:13.276
because this centre has the first responsibility

25
01:08:13.477 --> 01:08:18.744
to convert the fat cells in the stomach for the use of the brain,

26
01:08:18.944 --> 01:08:25.223
which is overused, to make them into grey cells.

27
01:08:26.010 --> 01:08:30.217
So, when you start thinking too much,

28
01:08:30.417 --> 01:08:37.190
it has to work more for this very important function.

29
01:08:38.397 --> 01:08:41.510
When it starts working for one function,

30
01:08:41.710 --> 01:08:45.290
the other functions are neglected.

31
01:08:45.490 --> 01:08:48.783
And the other functions are:

32
01:08:48.983 --> 01:08:55.517
it has to cater, to nourish or to give energy to your liver,

33
01:08:55.730 --> 01:09:03.976
to your pancreas, to your spleen, to your kidneys and part of your intestine.

34
01:09:05.797 --> 01:09:11.523
So, once you start neglecting these organs,

35
01:09:11.723 --> 01:09:15.810
first your liver suffers.

36
01:09:16.010 --> 01:09:20.763
Means, the function of liver gets limited.

37
01:09:20.963 --> 01:09:26.543
The function basically of the liver, basically, is

38
01:09:26.743 --> 01:09:32.183
to absorb the heat of the body which is the poison

39
01:09:32.383 --> 01:09:40.137
and allow it to permeate into the bloodstream.

40
01:09:40.337 --> 01:09:47.037
But the energy is so limited that it cannot function properly.

41
01:09:47.237 --> 01:09:54.563
So, this centre starts neglecting liver

42
01:09:54.763 --> 01:10:00.843
and liver then cannot get rid of all the heat of the body,

43
01:10:01.043 --> 01:10:05.650
so the heat starts flowing upward.

44
01:10:07.050 --> 01:10:10.157
When it starts flowing upward, then there’s a centre,

45
01:10:10.357 --> 01:10:16.143
what you call as the Right Heart, which gets affected.

46
01:10:16.343 --> 01:10:21.130
People develop a disease called asthma with it.

47
01:10:22.130 --> 01:10:24.470
Also, they develop a disease

48
01:10:24.670 --> 01:10:29.323
what you call as a massive heart attack, on the left-hand side,

49
01:10:29.523 --> 01:10:31.583
when the heat reaches there.

50
01:10:31.783 --> 01:10:37.490
They also can develop a paralysis of the right side

51
01:10:37.690 --> 01:10:41.150
when it reaches the brain.

52
01:10:41.350 --> 01:10:44.863
The vulnerability is there.

53
01:10:45.063 --> 01:10:50.990
And then it’s triggered somehow by the left side action, maybe.

54
01:10:54.517 --> 01:10:59.437
Such people are futuristic, they go on planning for the future.

55
01:10:59.637 --> 01:11:04.983
Future doesn’t exist, only the present is the truth.

56
01:11:05.184 --> 01:11:09.343
But they go on planning about future, waste their energies

57
01:11:09.543 --> 01:11:13.483
and ultimately find that all their plans fail.

58
01:11:13.683 --> 01:11:16.302
One must know the Divine plan.

59
01:11:16.503 --> 01:11:19.815
If you know the Divine plan, then you don’t have to plan

60
01:11:20.016 --> 01:11:24.390
because you know the Divine is already planning for you everything.

61
01:11:24.590 --> 01:11:27.830
When you understand after Realisation that everything is done

62
01:11:28.030 --> 01:11:33.030
by Paramchaitanya, by this All-Pervading Power, by this Ruh,

63
01:11:33.230 --> 01:11:40.723
then you do not think that you are doing something.

64
01:11:40.924 --> 01:11:43.062
Moreover, as I told you,

65
01:11:43.263 --> 01:11:47.277
when the Kundalini rises through the Agnya Chakra,

66
01:11:47.477 --> 01:11:52.577
both these institutions of ego and superego are sucked in,

67
01:11:52.777 --> 01:11:57.163
so there is no ego, so you become egoless,

68
01:11:57.363 --> 01:12:02.050
so your karmas or your duties or your so-called work

69
01:12:02.251 --> 01:12:06.937
you have done become akarmas.
Then you don’t talk like this,

70
01:12:07.137 --> 01:12:09.680
that “I have done this, I have done that.”

71
01:12:09.880 --> 01:12:13.377
They say, “Oh it’s rising, it’s happening, it’s working out.”

72
01:12:13.577 --> 01:12:16.543
You start speaking in the third person.

73
01:12:16.743 --> 01:12:20.597
Even sometimes children you will find they talk like that.

74
01:12:20.797 --> 01:12:26.076
“This little boy won’t go because it is obstinate.” They’ll talk about themselves.

75
01:12:26.277 --> 01:12:29.095
If you notice, if they’re realised souls, they’ll talk like that,

76
01:12:29.296 --> 01:12:32.990
in the third person.

77
01:12:33.317 --> 01:12:37.677
So, you become a third person.

78
01:12:38.830 --> 01:12:44.137
And nourishment to this centre comes through your Realisation

79
01:12:44.337 --> 01:12:48.070
as the Kundalini is connected to the mains.

80
01:12:48.270 --> 01:12:51.690
As a result, you get into balance.

81
01:12:51.891 --> 01:12:54.322
You are in thoughtless awareness.

82
01:12:54.523 --> 01:12:57.737
Somebody has asked Me about the thinking, yesterday.

83
01:12:57.937 --> 01:13:03.469
So, the thought arises from the past or from the future.

84
01:13:03.670 --> 01:13:06.877
As we have a capacity to react,

85
01:13:07.077 --> 01:13:12.103
because of the construction of our body as a prism.

86
01:13:12.303 --> 01:13:17.463
It’s a little scientific thing, but if you listen to some of My lectures,

87
01:13:17.663 --> 01:13:19.917
you’ll understand what I mean.

88
01:13:20.117 --> 01:13:22.417
Now what happens, when you see something, you react,

89
01:13:22.617 --> 01:13:26.757
anything you see, you react. You see this carpet, you’ll react.

90
01:13:26.957 --> 01:13:32.830
You’ll see this mic, you’ll react. You’ll think something about it.

91
01:13:34.670 --> 01:13:40.130
So, a thought comes either from the future or from the past

92
01:13:40.330 --> 01:13:43.397
and there’s a wave of thought coming and going,

93
01:13:43.597 --> 01:13:52.203
again thought coming and going. It comes and disappears.

94
01:13:52.403 --> 01:13:57.489
In between these thoughts, there’s a little space which is the present.

95
01:13:57.690 --> 01:14:01.415
But if I say "you pay attention to yourself, to your present",

96
01:14:01.616 --> 01:14:06.483
you cannot, unless and until you are a realised soul.

97
01:14:06.683 --> 01:14:09.310
So, when the Kundalini rises, these thoughts become –

98
01:14:09.510 --> 01:14:12.357
they lean out, means they become thin.

99
01:14:12.557 --> 01:14:18.330
When they become thin, the space in between increases

100
01:14:18.530 --> 01:14:22.637
and that’s how you become thoughtlessly aware.

101
01:14:22.837 --> 01:14:26.820
So, the thinking is minimised,

102
01:14:27.020 --> 01:14:30.507
then the liver doesn’t have to do all the time the job of converting

103
01:14:30.707 --> 01:14:35.417
your fat cells into grey cells.

104
01:14:36.063 --> 01:14:39.650
It comes into balance.

105
01:14:39.850 --> 01:14:46.795
Then the second one is the pancreas. That is neglected, too.

106
01:14:46.996 --> 01:14:50.516
In a person who is futuristic, who thinks too much, plans too much,

107
01:14:50.716 --> 01:14:54.137
that also becomes neglected.

108
01:14:54.337 --> 01:14:59.543
Now, the function of the pancreas is to absorb

109
01:14:59.743 --> 01:15:08.630
the sugar into bloodstream in a proper way.

110
01:15:09.883 --> 01:15:12.997
But because it is neglected, it has a very limited energy,

111
01:15:13.197 --> 01:15:17.670
it cannot function, so you get diabetes.

112
01:15:18.776 --> 01:15:22.283
Because of too much thinking, you get diabetes.

113
01:15:22.483 --> 01:15:29.430
As I told you yesterday that in India, if you have to give tea to someone,

114
01:15:29.630 --> 01:15:32.143
be careful if he is from a village,

115
01:15:32.343 --> 01:15:36.503
because in the village, you have to put so much sugar

116
01:15:36.703 --> 01:15:41.390
that the spoon should stand at right angles. Otherwise, it’s no tea for them.

117
01:15:41.590 --> 01:15:45.017
And they never get diabetes, never get diabetes.

118
01:15:45.217 --> 01:15:50.263
Diabetes is the headache of the people who sit on chairs, write,

119
01:15:50.464 --> 01:15:56.597
think,worry and are time bound.

120
01:15:56.797 --> 01:16:04.270
All such people get diabetes. They’re futuristic,

121
01:16:04.470 --> 01:16:09.483
egoistical, arrogant, hot-tempered.

122
01:16:10.523 --> 01:16:16.183
And such people get also heart attacks which are of a massive nature.

123
01:16:16.383 --> 01:16:23.163
The Left Heart is connected in a way,

124
01:16:23.363 --> 01:16:28.123
when there’s too much of exertion on the physical side also

125
01:16:28.323 --> 01:16:32.423
one can get heart attack.

126
01:16:32.623 --> 01:16:36.443
The another type of heart attack one gets is angina,

127
01:16:36.643 --> 01:16:41.643
that’s due to some other reason, that’s due to the lethargic heart.

128
01:16:41.843 --> 01:16:48.218
So now we have another problem which is very serious is that of the spleen.

129
01:16:48.419 --> 01:16:54.070
Spleen is the speedometer. It’s the one that gives us rhythm.

130
01:16:54.270 --> 01:16:59.330
If we are rhythmic in life, spleen keeps all right.

131
01:16:59.530 --> 01:17:02.423
But we are very hectic.

132
01:17:02.623 --> 01:17:10.446
And the function of the spleen is to create red blood corpuscles

133
01:17:10.653 --> 01:17:14.863
whenever there is an emergency.

134
01:17:15.063 --> 01:17:18.523
So, the way we are, we are always under a shock.

135
01:17:18.723 --> 01:17:23.183
Early in the morning you get up, what do you see?

136
01:17:23.383 --> 01:17:29.871
You read the newspaper, horrid news.

137
01:17:30.072 --> 01:17:33.990
I mean newspapers have to give horrid news, they never give good news, you know.

138
01:17:34.190 --> 01:17:37.763
They say, “We don’t want to say if some plane has landed safely.”

139
01:17:37.963 --> 01:17:45.672
But if there’s a disaster, so many have died, killed in action,

140
01:17:45.873 --> 01:17:50.640
murders, horrible things, naturally you get a shock,

141
01:17:50.840 --> 01:17:58.397
because you are a human being and in a subconscious you feel,

142
01:17:58.597 --> 01:18:05.297
in unconscious area, you get the jerk. There’s a shock.

143
01:18:05.497 --> 01:18:09.017
Then you start

144
01:18:09.218 --> 01:18:12.730
the day in a hectic way, you are time-bound, you have to rush,

145
01:18:12.931 --> 01:18:16.276
you can’t take your breakfast, you just take something, grab,

146
01:18:16.477 --> 01:18:18.456
rush to the car or maybe on anything

147
01:18:18.657 --> 01:18:21.257
and then you find the jam in modern days.

148
01:18:21.457 --> 01:18:25.760
Everything keeps you on a tension. Then you reach the office,

149
01:18:25.960 --> 01:18:29.083
there’s the boss who’s getting angry with you because you’re late.

150
01:18:29.283 --> 01:18:32.997
As it is, I don’t know how much work we really produce.

151
01:18:33.197 --> 01:18:35.363
Only the mess we have created in this world, I think,

152
01:18:35.563 --> 01:18:39.990
much more in the modern times than much work.

153
01:18:40.190 --> 01:18:42.950
We cannot have people like Mozart nowadays,

154
01:18:43.150 --> 01:18:49.843
we can’t have anyone like Michelangelo,

155
01:18:50.043 --> 01:18:55.510
we cannot have any artists who can create beautiful things,

156
01:18:55.710 --> 01:19:00.690
we do not have beautiful buildings now, horrible, plastics.

157
01:19:00.890 --> 01:19:05.863
We cannot have beautiful, artistic clothes.

158
01:19:06.063 --> 01:19:10.410
Everything is becoming plastic and for which,

159
01:19:10.610 --> 01:19:16.737
we are working so very hard to create plastic mountains.

160
01:19:18.770 --> 01:19:24.503
All this leads to tensions, so we become tense.

161
01:19:24.703 --> 01:19:29.543
And the tensions go on increasing as this ego increases,

162
01:19:29.743 --> 01:19:36.536
covers all your head and you go into tension.

163
01:19:37.263 --> 01:19:40.883
But the worst thing that happens to you that this spleen

164
01:19:41.083 --> 01:19:48.775
which is the one responsible for keeping the rhythm of your life, goes hectic

165
01:19:48.976 --> 01:19:54.303
and becomes crazy, doesn’t understand what sort of a personality you are.

166
01:19:54.503 --> 01:19:57.070
Sometimes you rush to that, sometimes you rush to that.

167
01:19:57.270 --> 01:20:00.037
There’s no rhythm in the life.

168
01:20:00.237 --> 01:20:06.097
So, it gets upset

169
01:20:06.297 --> 01:20:11.643
and it starts producing red blood corpuscles unrhythmically,

170
01:20:11.843 --> 01:20:15.790
it doesn’t know. So, the vulnerability is there.

171
01:20:15.990 --> 01:20:19.257
And as soon as there’s any triggering from the left side,

172
01:20:19.457 --> 01:20:23.097
you develop a horrible disease called blood cancer,

173
01:20:23.297 --> 01:20:26.663
and the only treatment you can have in the medical science is that

174
01:20:26.863 --> 01:20:31.943
you’ll be certified that you’ll die after eight days or after one month.

175
01:20:32.143 --> 01:20:36.303
That’s the only possibility.

176
01:20:37.137 --> 01:20:46.563
But, with Kundalini awakening, your own power nourishes this centre

177
01:20:46.763 --> 01:20:54.923
and supplies energy, soothes down your hectic speedometer.

178
01:20:55.123 --> 01:21:00.237
which is the spleen. and the disease gets cured.

179
01:21:00.437 --> 01:21:06.190
There are many we know of who got their blood cancer cured

180
01:21:06.390 --> 01:21:12.263
and even after six, seven years they’re living and kicking all right.

181
01:21:13.170 --> 01:21:16.610
All this is available to you within yourself.

182
01:21:16.810 --> 01:21:21.170
This is all been promised. Many great people have written about it.

183
01:21:21.370 --> 01:21:25.697
It’s not that I’m saying something new. Only the new thing

184
01:21:25.897 --> 01:21:31.464
we are seeing here is that you can get en masse Realisation.

185
01:21:32.443 --> 01:21:35.737
Then is the kidney. Kidney also gets affected,

186
01:21:35.937 --> 01:21:40.570
firstly by the heat of the liver, secondly

187
01:21:40.770 --> 01:21:48.670
by the strenuous type of life you lead, futuristic, neglected,

188
01:21:48.870 --> 01:21:52.203
and then you get blood pressures.

189
01:21:52.403 --> 01:21:55.597
Blood pressures you get till you get failure of your kidneys

190
01:21:55.797 --> 01:22:00.123
or you might get a paralysis, anything is possible.

191
01:22:00.323 --> 01:22:05.870
So, we have blood pressure, high blood pressure.

192
01:22:07.023 --> 01:22:12.190
All this is only because of one centre, when it is out of gear.

193
01:22:12.390 --> 01:22:15.189
But if all the seven centres are out of gear,

194
01:22:15.390 --> 01:22:19.842
what should happen to us?

195
01:22:20.043 --> 01:22:24.930
And I think the modern life is such that it could be,

196
01:22:25.130 --> 01:22:28.057
all centres could be in danger.

197
01:22:28.257 --> 01:22:34.360
So, it is eminent, is important that we should get

198
01:22:34.560 --> 01:22:40.997
our Kundalini awakened and we should enjoy the best health.

199
01:22:41.197 --> 01:22:47.523
Health of course you enjoy very well, no doubt. But apart from health,

200
01:22:47.723 --> 01:22:53.997
apart from health, apart from health,

201
01:22:54.210 --> 01:23:00.097
you enjoy many other things. First of all, you enjoy yourself.

202
01:23:00.543 --> 01:23:06.610
Today there’s no time to discuss all the centres, but still I would say

203
01:23:06.810 --> 01:23:11.977
that I would like to give you all the benefits of Sahaja Yoga,

204
01:23:12.177 --> 01:23:19.290
which are possible, that you start enjoying others.

205
01:23:21.230 --> 01:23:24.643
You become righteous, as I told you,

206
01:23:24.843 --> 01:23:28.750
and you start enjoying your virtues.

207
01:23:28.950 --> 01:23:34.497
You are no more a critic of things. If you have to criticise,

208
01:23:34.697 --> 01:23:41.017
you criticise yourself, laugh at yourself and you don’t laugh at others.

209
01:23:41.217 --> 01:23:48.497
You start connecting yourself, if you have the art of Kundalini awakening,

210
01:23:48.697 --> 01:23:51.800
because yoga means, of course, the union with the Divine.

211
01:23:52.000 --> 01:23:55.237
Also means ‘yukti’, meaning ‘the deftness’,

212
01:23:55.437 --> 01:24:03.364
deftness to raise the Kundalini of yours and of others.

213
01:24:06.283 --> 01:24:10.937
If you know the decoding of these centres,

214
01:24:11.137 --> 01:24:14.800
of these centres on your fingertips –

215
01:24:15.000 --> 01:24:20.717
five, six and seven on the left side and five, six and seven on the right side –

216
01:24:20.917 --> 01:24:26.617
if you just know the decoding, immediately you can do the diagnosis,

217
01:24:26.817 --> 01:24:30.850
what is wrong basically with you, and you can correct it.

218
01:24:31.050 --> 01:24:38.250
So physically, mentally, emotionally you can correct yourself;

219
01:24:38.450 --> 01:24:42.077
and spiritually you ascend.

220
01:24:42.277 --> 01:24:46.450
You ascend to a state of a saint, a sage.

221
01:24:46.650 --> 01:24:50.350
And the time has come for us to become sages.

222
01:24:50.550 --> 01:24:55.222
For that you don’t have to leave your homes, houses, run away from your families,

223
01:24:55.423 --> 01:25:01.590
nothing. That’s an escape. You don’t have to suffer.

224
01:25:01.790 --> 01:25:05.823
You have to enter into the Kingdom of God to enjoy

225
01:25:06.023 --> 01:25:10.010
that beauty and bounty of His Love.

226
01:25:10.210 --> 01:25:15.190
Now this balance is important within us.

227
01:25:15.763 --> 01:25:21.783
There’s one more disease, a very common one in the West

228
01:25:21.983 --> 01:25:28.683
is the cancer of the breast in the case of women, which comes from the centre of Heart.

229
01:25:28.883 --> 01:25:33.057
The centre, there are three hearts according to Sahaja Yoga,

230
01:25:33.257 --> 01:25:36.930
one is the Central Heart, one is Left and one Right.

231
01:25:37.130 --> 01:25:42.457
Now the Central Heart is placed in the spinal cord,

232
01:25:42.657 --> 01:25:46.730
below the sternum bone.

233
01:25:46.930 --> 01:25:52.362
Sternum bone is the one that creates the antibodies till the age of twelve years.

234
01:25:52.563 --> 01:25:56.970
And then they get distributed all over.

235
01:25:57.170 --> 01:26:01.450
And these antibodies then fight all the emergencies

236
01:26:01.650 --> 01:26:04.883
and overcome all the troubles for us,

237
01:26:05.083 --> 01:26:08.110
but then they can become also very weak.

238
01:26:08.310 --> 01:26:13.557
So, the remote control is in the sternum bone.

239
01:26:13.757 --> 01:26:18.007
Now this centre is the centre of a Mother,

240
01:26:18.207 --> 01:26:21.237
of the Primordial Mother, we can say,

241
01:26:21.437 --> 01:26:26.083
of the Mother Who is the Mother of this Universe and Mother of this world,

242
01:26:26.283 --> 01:26:34.443
Who looks after the security of children, security of the people.

243
01:26:35.497 --> 01:26:40.716
When a woman is challenged in her motherhood,

244
01:26:40.917 --> 01:26:42.917
supposing she is a wife of someone

245
01:26:43.117 --> 01:26:47.437
and husband is giving her insecurities by any means,

246
01:26:47.637 --> 01:26:51.322
supposing his is a wayward person or he’s always threatening her

247
01:26:51.523 --> 01:26:55.230
or dominating her or challenging her,

248
01:26:55.430 --> 01:27:01.470
her security gets disturbed and then this trouble starts.

249
01:27:01.670 --> 01:27:06.157
Maybe her children, maybe anyone can give this insecurity to a woman

250
01:27:06.357 --> 01:27:12.877
and that’s how she develops this cancer of the breast.

251
01:27:13.077 --> 01:27:17.429
That also can be corrected if the Kundalini could be made to pass through

252
01:27:17.630 --> 01:27:21.790
this centre and nourish it.

253
01:27:26.517 --> 01:27:34.224
The centre that is the most important is the seventh centre.

254
01:27:35.357 --> 01:27:39.290
The seventh centre is the centre which is placed

255
01:27:39.490 --> 01:27:47.049
around the limbic area in the head,

256
01:27:47.250 --> 01:27:51.130
which has got one thousand petals

257
01:27:51.330 --> 01:27:55.883
and when enlightened, it looks like beautiful flames,

258
01:27:56.083 --> 01:28:03.316
very wide flames just like petals of all the seven colours.

259
01:28:03.810 --> 01:28:12.443
That’s why it is said in the Bible, “I’ll appear before you like flames.”

260
01:28:13.703 --> 01:28:17.890
These are the flames, you see.

261
01:28:19.237 --> 01:28:23.840
This is the most important thing because around the limbic area

262
01:28:24.040 --> 01:28:31.597
are placed all the seats, governing seats of all the centres.

263
01:28:31.797 --> 01:28:40.303
So, if this centre is fully opened out,

264
01:28:40.503 --> 01:28:44.863
they all get drenched by the grace of the Divine Power

265
01:28:45.063 --> 01:28:50.763
and the person really, really enjoys Sahaja Yoga

266
01:28:50.963 --> 01:28:54.323
in the best possible way.

267
01:28:54.523 --> 01:29:03.537
He’s a happy person, he’s a joyous person, he emits joy, he emits peace,

268
01:29:03.737 --> 01:29:08.263
he’s compassionate, he’s tireless, he looks after people

269
01:29:08.463 --> 01:29:16.550
and such a person can achieve great heights of purity within himself.

270
01:29:16.857 --> 01:29:20.509
The another centre which is bestowed by Christ, as I told yesterday,

271
01:29:20.710 --> 01:29:26.417
is the Agnya Chakra, which is also very important,

272
01:29:26.617 --> 01:29:33.883
because Christ has said, “Thou shalt not have adulterous eyes.”

273
01:29:34.083 --> 01:29:37.417
That’s what He has said it. You should find out among Christian nations,

274
01:29:37.617 --> 01:29:42.684
how many have got such pure eyes.

275
01:29:43.583 --> 01:29:47.630
Pure eyes means those who do not react, just witness, watch.

276
01:29:47.830 --> 01:29:51.843
There’s no greed, there’s no lust in those eyes.

277
01:29:52.043 --> 01:29:56.723
Such eyes are so powerful that even a glance of such an eye

278
01:29:56.923 --> 01:30:00.370
can give salvation.

279
01:30:00.570 --> 01:30:06.550
And this is what it is: we have to achieve the pure eyes.

280
01:30:06.750 --> 01:30:14.577
Such pure eyes are the only one which give you the joy of seeing.

281
01:30:16.276 --> 01:30:18.530
Of course, you’ll have the books, you can read them

282
01:30:18.731 --> 01:30:23.057
and find out about all the centres and know about it.

283
01:30:23.257 --> 01:30:29.323
But what we have to see is that the problems of the world are because of us.

284
01:30:29.523 --> 01:30:33.263
We are the problems and we manifest the problems outside

285
01:30:33.463 --> 01:30:38.320
which reflect back upon us like the waves come back

286
01:30:38.520 --> 01:30:45.130
and dash against the shore and again are reflected back.

287
01:30:46.117 --> 01:30:53.170
We have to, ourselves, get into the state of sages.

288
01:30:53.697 --> 01:30:56.360
Then nobody has to tell you, “Do this” or “Do that.”

289
01:30:56.560 --> 01:30:59.377
You become your own master, you become your own guru,

290
01:30:59.577 --> 01:31:02.583
and you look after yourself.

291
01:31:02.783 --> 01:31:05.203
I have to apologise for one thing,

292
01:31:05.403 --> 01:31:13.610
that Sahaja Yoga started in Australia with a little jerk.

293
01:31:13.810 --> 01:31:16.337
They were Australians who started it,

294
01:31:16.537 --> 01:31:20.123
but they were not up to the mark, I must say they were not,

295
01:31:20.323 --> 01:31:23.930
created lots of problem for us, lots of problems.

296
01:31:24.130 --> 01:31:26.610
And we didn’t know what to do with them. It has happened nowhere

297
01:31:26.810 --> 01:31:29.823
in the world as it has happened here.

298
01:31:30.023 --> 01:31:37.703
I don’t know why it took lot of time for it to properly establish itself.

299
01:31:38.310 --> 01:31:42.870
Thank God now we have people who are sensible

300
01:31:43.070 --> 01:31:46.577
and I hope you will make it convenient after getting your Realisation

301
01:31:46.777 --> 01:31:51.297
to establish yourself properly, establish yourself

302
01:31:51.497 --> 01:31:56.803
and reach that state of Nirvikalpa, doubtless awareness.

303
01:31:57.003 --> 01:32:00.777
If you have any problem, you should write to Me directly.

304
01:32:00.977 --> 01:32:06.120
You don’t have to bear anything. Christ has already taken the cross upon Himself,

305
01:32:06.320 --> 01:32:10.417
so we don’t have to do anything. If there’s any problem

306
01:32:10.617 --> 01:32:14.823
that you find is not all right, you should write to Me

307
01:32:15.023 --> 01:32:25.663
instead of getting disappointed or getting frustrated.

308
01:32:25.863 --> 01:32:31.990
Is best is to write to Me. I know it’s far away, Australia is very far off.

309
01:32:32.190 --> 01:32:36.490
But this is the land which is the land of purity.

310
01:32:36.690 --> 01:32:43.630
This is the land in the universe is the first centre that you see there,

311
01:32:43.830 --> 01:32:51.149
and Uluru that you have – Uluru means, as I told you, is the Chaitanya,

312
01:32:51.350 --> 01:32:57.503
is the symbol of that purity.

313
01:32:58.250 --> 01:33:03.243
So, you stand for the innocence of the world.

314
01:33:03.443 --> 01:33:08.043
You are such a great nation here that stands for the innocence,

315
01:33:08.243 --> 01:33:13.623
and you could be very gullible. So, you have to be careful

316
01:33:13.823 --> 01:33:18.483
and understand your own identity as innocent people.

317
01:33:18.683 --> 01:33:23.430
And I am sure it will work out very well for all of you.

318
01:33:24.650 --> 01:33:28.757
And this country which has many problems will be solved

319
01:33:28.957 --> 01:33:32.903
by your own purity and the whole world can be helped

320
01:33:33.103 --> 01:33:37.190
with your own purity and beautiful lives.

321
01:33:37.390 --> 01:33:41.497
May God bless you.

322
01:33:56.223 --> 01:34:00.710
Yesterday we had too many questions.

323
01:34:00.910 --> 01:34:03.870
Too many.

324
01:34:06.843 --> 01:34:13.083
And I told you that by asking questions –

325
01:34:13.283 --> 01:34:16.863
I can answer all of them, I think so,

326
01:34:17.064 --> 01:34:21.096
but I cannot guarantee that if I answer you

327
01:34:21.317 --> 01:34:27.190
that means I can give you awakening. It’s not guaranteed that way.

328
01:34:27.390 --> 01:34:31.343
So, if you want to have your Realisation

329
01:34:31.543 --> 01:34:36.703
and if there is any problem that stands between that Realisation and yourself,

330
01:34:36.903 --> 01:34:40.603
then it is better you should ask Me some question.

331
01:34:40.803 --> 01:34:44.903
It’s much better to save time.

332
01:34:59.497 --> 01:35:02.037
[Is raising the Kundalini dangerous?]

333
01:35:02.237 --> 01:35:07.470
Not at all. Kundalini is your Mother.

334
01:35:07.670 --> 01:35:16.369
She’s your individual mother and She looks after you. She knows everything about you.

335
01:35:16.570 --> 01:35:20.197
She’s taped everything that you have been doing, you have been desiring.

336
01:35:20.397 --> 01:35:22.403
She knows everything about you

337
01:35:22.604 --> 01:35:26.237
and She’s anxiously waiting to give you your second birth.

338
01:35:26.437 --> 01:35:34.290
As your mother took up upon herself all the labour pains,

339
01:35:34.490 --> 01:35:39.023
She takes all the troubles for Herself.

340
01:35:39.223 --> 01:35:46.390
We have had so many people. I have never seen anyone getting into trouble.

341
01:35:46.590 --> 01:35:51.323
This myth has been created by people who are money-oriented, I think,

342
01:35:51.523 --> 01:35:58.196
who wanted to frighten you so that you don’t go to reality and pay them well.

343
01:36:01.343 --> 01:36:05.830
[Could You define “Kundalini”?]

344
01:36:06.030 --> 01:36:10.017
Yesterday I did. You came today only, madam? Oh, I see.

345
01:36:10.217 --> 01:36:13.497
Kundalini is a power, as I told you, is a residual power,

346
01:36:13.697 --> 01:36:18.830
is the fourth power within us which resides in the triangular bone

347
01:36:19.030 --> 01:36:22.623
in three and a half coils.

348
01:36:22.823 --> 01:36:27.990
And It rises through six centres, subtle centres.

349
01:36:28.190 --> 01:36:32.050
This is the power of your pure desire.

350
01:36:32.250 --> 01:36:38.803
All other desires are impure because they’re never satiable in general.

351
01:36:39.003 --> 01:36:44.583
The only desire that is pure is to be one with the Divine.

352
01:36:45.703 --> 01:36:51.749
[Hindi]

353
01:36:57.417 --> 01:37:00.910
Nanak Sahib has described as surti.

354
01:37:01.110 --> 01:37:04.577
Kabira especially has described it as surti.

355
01:37:04.777 --> 01:37:07.617
But imagine human beings how they are.

356
01:37:07.817 --> 01:37:14.243
Kabira was born in Bihar, most of his work was in Bihar.

357
01:37:14.443 --> 01:37:22.583
Later on, he went to Punjab. And in Bihar, they call tobacco as surti.

358
01:37:24.363 --> 01:37:31.350
Yes, in Bihar they do. It’s very surprising to call tobacco as surti.

359
01:37:33.010 --> 01:37:35.200
So many things of Granth Sahib can only be understood

360
01:37:35.400 --> 01:37:38.863
when you get your Self Realisation, otherwise you cannot.

361
01:37:39.063 --> 01:37:44.203
Is said it [Hindi].

362
01:37:52.143 --> 01:37:58.810
What is this apa? Is your Self. He is the one who has done the tremendous work on this.

363
01:37:59.010 --> 01:38:07.377
Tremendous work on Kundalini, all of them, Namadeva.

364
01:38:08.517 --> 01:38:13.684
Even to think of them is great.

365
01:38:32.570 --> 01:38:39.010
[How is that you can control your ego and all that as well as the (...)]

366
01:38:39.210 --> 01:38:44.402
Yah. This is the first temptation you have. Yah, yah, yah. Agreed with you

367
01:38:44.603 --> 01:38:47.795
that it starts giving you ego if you are not

368
01:38:47.996 --> 01:38:50.120
fully developed in Sahaja Yoga. This is the first temptation,

369
01:38:50.320 --> 01:38:53.442
I know that. But people become very creative.

370
01:38:53.643 --> 01:38:56.143
It has happened to many Sahaja Yogis I have seen,

371
01:38:56.343 --> 01:39:00.000
they became very creative, they started producing lot of potteries

372
01:39:00.200 --> 01:39:04.103
and things, and started producing beautiful paintings.

373
01:39:04.303 --> 01:39:08.090
There was one Australian lady she produced very beautiful paintings

374
01:39:08.290 --> 01:39:13.836
and she got, won fame and all that, and ego had blasted her completely.

375
01:39:14.037 --> 01:39:17.156
And she came to see Me in Perth, I found such heat coming out of her,

376
01:39:17.357 --> 01:39:20.877
like a cancer patient, absolutely like a cancer patient.

377
01:39:21.077 --> 01:39:23.783
And then if you tell her, “You have got ego”, they don’t like it,

378
01:39:23.983 --> 01:39:27.903
because they’re so egoistical.

379
01:39:28.104 --> 01:39:33.360
That’s why, that's why, that's why  you have to take

380
01:39:33.560 --> 01:39:37.183
the Kundalini always up there. You shouldn’t be satisfied.

381
01:39:37.383 --> 01:39:42.169
You see, that’s the slipping point sometimes, so be careful, be careful.

382
01:39:42.370 --> 01:39:46.517
Now look at these artists, they are so simple.

383
01:39:46.717 --> 01:39:51.177
Our attention should be, “What have I attained in Sahaja Yoga?

384
01:39:51.377 --> 01:39:54.190
Is my spiritual ascent”. This is just a temptation,

385
01:39:54.390 --> 01:39:58.410
one of the temptations that people have.

386
01:39:58.610 --> 01:40:01.597
That’s not so important.

387
01:40:01.797 --> 01:40:04.810
Now for these artists, the most important thing is just to play for Me,

388
01:40:05.010 --> 01:40:07.736
that’s all.

389
01:40:22.942 --> 01:40:25.442
[You say we shouldn’t plan too much. Could You explain

390
01:40:25.643 --> 01:40:30.950
that because obviously we need to plan a little.]

391
01:40:32.403 --> 01:40:38.223
You see, if you are in Sahaja Yoga and in meditative mood.

392
01:40:39.350 --> 01:40:46.283
If you’re in a meditative mood and if you’re in Sahaja Yoga,

393
01:40:46.483 --> 01:40:49.457
then you just don’t plan,

394
01:40:49.657 --> 01:40:54.677
because you know the planning is already done for you.

395
01:40:54.877 --> 01:40:59.875
I know that if you take the name of “airport”, only “airport”,

396
01:41:00.076 --> 01:41:05.197
you take the name and most of the men will start jumping.

397
01:41:05.397 --> 01:41:10.263
They’ll go at least one hour earlier than reporting time.

398
01:41:10.463 --> 01:41:17.124
Aeroplane is not going to fly out, you see, but they fear that it will fly out.

399
01:41:17.325 --> 01:41:24.743
Now, if you are a Sahaja Yogi and if you are going for catching a plane,

400
01:41:24.943 --> 01:41:29.343
say example, you should know what time you have to leave

401
01:41:29.543 --> 01:41:33.217
and you leave at that time, you’ll reach there in time.

402
01:41:33.417 --> 01:41:35.557
You don’t have to see, watch all the time, you’ll just leave at that time,

403
01:41:35.757 --> 01:41:41.309
exactly at that time, you’ll leave. But also, if you are a little late,

404
01:41:41.510 --> 01:41:43.483
the plane will be for you.

405
01:41:43.683 --> 01:41:51.035
But you don’t want to be unkind and the Paramachaitanya looks after you.

406
01:41:51.236 --> 01:41:55.309
You’ll just remember you have to go now, you leave that time.

407
01:41:55.510 --> 01:41:57.510
It is so simple.

408
01:41:57.711 --> 01:42:03.843
But to believe that Somebody Else is planning us is beyond our ego.

409
01:42:07.197 --> 01:42:11.103
What is it?

410
01:42:20.357 --> 01:42:23.330
[He says if he has to leave the planning of his life

411
01:42:23.531 --> 01:42:29.290
to someone else, he’s denying his own individuality,

412
01:42:33.690 --> 01:42:36.196
he’s denying that fact that he creates his own life

413
01:42:36.397 --> 01:42:38.470
if he leaves the planning.]

414
01:42:38.670 --> 01:42:41.950
That’s a good one, in a way is good.

415
01:42:42.150 --> 01:42:46.010
Why do you want to have this kind of a feeling that you are creating the world?

416
01:42:46.210 --> 01:42:52.630
Nobody’s creating. You can’t even create even a grain of clay.

417
01:42:52.830 --> 01:42:58.443
No, you can’t. You can’t create anything.

418
01:42:58.643 --> 01:43:00.643
What’s he saying?

419
01:43:00.844 --> 01:43:03.083
[He says he’s creating his own experience now

420
01:43:03.283 --> 01:43:08.290
just by raising his right hand or his left hand.]

421
01:43:14.003 --> 01:43:17.229
You see you have to be little deeper to understand the significance.

422
01:43:17.430 --> 01:43:19.890
Also to have faith in yourself

423
01:43:20.090 --> 01:43:25.650
that supposing you become connected with the Divine Power.

424
01:43:25.850 --> 01:43:31.637
Now, I’ll tell you what. Supposing you see a television. All right?

425
01:43:31.837 --> 01:43:35.310
The television is connected to the mains there. All right.

426
01:43:35.510 --> 01:43:39.357
Now you want to see Shakespeare, for example, that’s your plan.

427
01:43:39.557 --> 01:43:43.237
But there’s another plan there going on, and when you open,

428
01:43:43.437 --> 01:43:47.115
it’s not Shakespeare, it’s something else. So, what do you do?

429
01:43:47.316 --> 01:43:51.470
Do you loose your identity?

430
01:44:02.896 --> 01:44:05.630
Now it’s all right for him.

431
01:44:05.830 --> 01:44:08.517
All right, you follow My advice and you’ll see what I am saying.

432
01:44:08.717 --> 01:44:12.197
All right? Now just give it a chance. Give it a chance.

433
01:44:12.397 --> 01:44:18.929
First of all, get your Realisation and give it a chance. All right?

434
01:44:34.617 --> 01:44:36.289
What she is saying?

435
01:44:36.490 --> 01:44:40.463
[What is the best way to go towards Self Realisation?]

436
01:44:41.297 --> 01:44:44.583
That’s what we are going to do. All right? That’s a very good question.

437
01:44:44.783 --> 01:44:51.276
You just wait. After all these questions are over, we’ll have that.

438
01:45:12.257 --> 01:45:16.640
[He says he understands why our own actions cause

439
01:45:16.841 --> 01:45:19.237
imbalances in ourselves but how about young children?

440
01:45:19.437 --> 01:45:21.950
How do these diseases get caused in young children?]

441
01:45:22.150 --> 01:45:25.390
Now for example, a mother is a very busy lady. When the child is there,

442
01:45:25.590 --> 01:45:29.120
she’s doing all kinds of work and thinking too much, running too much.

443
01:45:29.320 --> 01:45:32.390
Or the father is doing that, that has an effect on the child.

444
01:45:32.590 --> 01:45:36.850
You see, human beings are delicately made.

445
01:45:37.323 --> 01:45:41.377
I mean in ancient times, if a woman was to have a baby,

446
01:45:41.577 --> 01:45:45.198
she used to take it very easy

447
01:45:45.399 --> 01:45:49.883
and she used to read something spiritual,

448
01:45:50.083 --> 01:45:54.630
she used to be thinking about her child

449
01:45:54.830 --> 01:45:59.550
and feeling that motherhood within herself.

450
01:45:59.750 --> 01:46:06.270
But the mother doesn’t think of the child. She just thinks she has to today go for hairdo

451
01:46:06.470 --> 01:46:11.810
or she has to do something, face lifting or something like that.

452
01:46:13.010 --> 01:46:18.603
I don’t know much about these things, but that’s what I’ve seen.

453
01:46:19.517 --> 01:46:24.790
It’s too much of superficiality

454
01:46:26.223 --> 01:46:31.643
And this has killed the beauty even of romance, you’ll be surprised.

455
01:46:31.843 --> 01:46:36.310
Absolutely, it’s absurd.

456
01:46:36.796 --> 01:46:41.920
These hair dressers have ruined the beauty of women in the way

457
01:46:42.120 --> 01:46:45.832
because somebody likes one particular type of hair dress,

458
01:46:46.033 --> 01:46:48.897
he falls in love with the hair dress. Now she changes her hair dress,

459
01:46:49.097 --> 01:46:52.257
he wants to have a divorce with her.

460
01:46:52.457 --> 01:46:56.677
So superficial attachments to superficial things.

461
01:46:56.877 --> 01:47:04.370
There’s no deeper attachments to innate,

462
01:47:04.570 --> 01:47:08.990
something so natural.

463
01:47:10.337 --> 01:47:13.387
Artificial things cannot lead us anywhere,

464
01:47:13.588 --> 01:47:18.133
they can never give us joy.

465
01:47:32.610 --> 01:47:34.423
[He is wanting Realisation futuristic?]

466
01:47:34.623 --> 01:47:40.562
Good. Good. Now what is she wanting here, this lady?

467
01:47:40.763 --> 01:47:43.623
That’s what I’m going to do, I’m very happy, that part you just forget,

468
01:47:43.823 --> 01:47:51.010
the rest of it. Is there any other question? Now let’s see.

469
01:47:59.123 --> 01:48:02.543
Will we see a time when most of the world will have their Realisation?]

470
01:48:02.743 --> 01:48:05.283
I hope so.

471
01:48:05.483 --> 01:48:08.280
I hope so.

472
01:48:11.190 --> 01:48:20.297
I would say that’s My dream. I wish, I wish that happens.

473
01:48:30.837 --> 01:48:36.336
I’m actually desireless. But your desires work.

474
01:48:36.537 --> 01:48:40.010
If you desire. Is the other way round. It’s not, “Thy will be done,”

475
01:48:40.210 --> 01:48:43.523
but it’s “Thy will be done.”

476
01:48:43.723 --> 01:48:49.416
If you desire, it will happen, it will happen.

477
01:49:12.755 --> 01:49:16.516
[Is it wrong to want or desire a family and have unity in a family

478
01:49:16.717 --> 01:49:19.270
and to enjoy the normal pleasures of life?]

479
01:49:19.470 --> 01:49:23.910
Not at all. I mean, we are marrying so many people.

480
01:49:24.110 --> 01:49:29.577
It’s not at all. It’s the best thing to have a family and children.

481
01:49:29.777 --> 01:49:32.030
But not to get involved so much into your family

482
01:49:32.230 --> 01:49:34.230
that you forget your ascent.

483
01:49:34.431 --> 01:49:36.797
How many times you are married in previous lives

484
01:49:36.997 --> 01:49:39.690
and how many children you have had in previous lives?

485
01:49:39.890 --> 01:49:41.983
Now this is the time for your ascent

486
01:49:42.183 --> 01:49:45.536
and your family should be complimentary.

487
01:49:45.737 --> 01:49:49.369
If it is not complimentary, it’s not going to help you. It is your choice,

488
01:49:49.570 --> 01:49:53.843
you’re free will. If you want to get dissolved into your own children,

489
01:49:54.043 --> 01:49:57.230
and your family only and not to have any ascent,

490
01:49:57.430 --> 01:49:59.910
nobody can force you, go ahead with it.

491
01:50:00.111 --> 01:50:02.329
But this time is important.

492
01:50:02.530 --> 01:50:05.643
This is an important time. Of course, you have to have family;

493
01:50:05.844 --> 01:50:10.103
of course, you have to get married. You have to lead a very normal life.

494
01:50:10.303 --> 01:50:15.617
Nothing abnormal. But if somebody is too much attached to the family,

495
01:50:15.817 --> 01:50:19.843
forgets his own ascent, then I think he is missing the point.

496
01:50:20.043 --> 01:50:24.657
That is the most important thing in life. Yes, please?

497
01:50:32.910 --> 01:50:37.017
[Isn’t the greatest danger in the future over population?]

498
01:50:37.217 --> 01:50:39.790
No, not at all. Actually, there are no imbalances

499
01:50:39.990 --> 01:50:42.597
that’s why there is a population growth in some countries

500
01:50:42.797 --> 01:50:45.730
and no population in some countries.

501
01:50:45.930 --> 01:50:51.423
Like on the BBC gentleman came and asked Me in London,

502
01:50:51.623 --> 01:50:54.617
he said, “Why do you have such a population growth?”

503
01:50:54.817 --> 01:50:57.377
First, he asked, I mean they are, you know after all,

504
01:50:57.577 --> 01:50:59.640
they can ask very funny questions.

505
01:50:59.840 --> 01:51:02.143
They have every right to do what they like.

506
01:51:02.343 --> 01:51:07.330
So, first question he asked, “Why? Wwhy is it in India

507
01:51:07.530 --> 01:51:09.643
you have so much poverty?”

508
01:51:09.843 --> 01:51:13.537
I said, “If you have a guest for three hundred years in your country,

509
01:51:13.737 --> 01:51:18.184
what will happen to you? You’ll become a broke.”

510
01:51:23.797 --> 01:51:26.810
Then he said that, “Such a population growth in Your country,

511
01:51:27.010 --> 01:51:29.823
what about that?” I said, “If you can allow Me,

512
01:51:30.023 --> 01:51:32.997
very humbly I would state you are responsible for that also.”

513
01:51:33.197 --> 01:51:35.317
He said, “How are we responsible?”

514
01:51:35.518 --> 01:51:40.083
I said, “In England, I used to hear that

515
01:51:40.283 --> 01:51:48.197
two children are killed every week in England by their parents.”

516
01:51:48.397 --> 01:51:52.383
He said, “No, only in London.” I said, “Really? That’s the case?

517
01:51:52.583 --> 01:51:58.256
So, what child, which child would like to be born in this country?”

518
01:51:59.730 --> 01:52:03.370
That’s why you see in Germany it’s minus, Sweden is minus,

519
01:52:03.570 --> 01:52:07.990
Norway is minus. All these countries are having minus growth

520
01:52:08.190 --> 01:52:12.463
and people are competing in committing suicide.

521
01:52:12.663 --> 01:52:15.110
Switzerland, there’s a competition on.

522
01:52:15.310 --> 01:52:18.017
All these countries are supposed to be affluent countries

523
01:52:18.217 --> 01:52:21.610
where they have money, they can look after their children better,

524
01:52:21.810 --> 01:52:26.490
they are competing in having suicides and in having minus growth.

525
01:52:26.690 --> 01:52:29.563
But in India, even if you have ten children or twelve children,

526
01:52:29.763 --> 01:52:32.030
love is all the time there available to them.

527
01:52:32.230 --> 01:52:36.337
And what a child needs is love, not all these pomp and show

528
01:52:36.537 --> 01:52:41.843
that you should have a nice cot or a nice this, but a loving mother.

529
01:52:42.044 --> 01:52:44.270
That’s why they come to India. Now if you create such mothers,

530
01:52:44.470 --> 01:52:48.730
they’ll come to you also.

531
01:53:22.243 --> 01:53:27.063
What is he saying? Question of woman and man, he is saying what?

532
01:53:27.264 --> 01:53:31.190
What exactly he did say?

533
01:53:40.023 --> 01:53:43.816
[How long should a man or a woman sleep?]

534
01:53:46.137 --> 01:53:49.403
You see, there’s no hard and fast rule for that,

535
01:53:49.604 --> 01:53:53.606
actually. I think as you grow old, you don’t sleep so much;

536
01:53:53.807 --> 01:53:59.457
I personally think that way. I sleep very little, Myself.

537
01:53:59.657 --> 01:54:05.337
In the night about three hours; in the daytime about one hour or so.

538
01:54:05.537 --> 01:54:08.610
But depends on, it depends.

539
01:54:08.810 --> 01:54:12.823
So, for sleeping, there’s no hard and fast rule,

540
01:54:13.023 --> 01:54:19.003
but whatever time you are born, that’s the time you want to sleep.

541
01:54:19.410 --> 01:54:22.770
So, some people like to sleep in the morning, all right let them sleep.

542
01:54:22.970 --> 01:54:26.949
And some people want to sleep in the night, let them sleep. Makes no difference.

543
01:54:27.150 --> 01:54:30.990
But after coming to Sahaja Yoga, all these conditionings disappear.

544
01:54:31.190 --> 01:54:34.470
And then you start behaving in a different manner.

545
01:54:34.670 --> 01:54:36.670
There’s a transformation.

546
01:54:36.871 --> 01:54:40.463
And then maximum time, you want to give for your meditation,

547
01:54:40.663 --> 01:54:44.803
for knowing about Sahaja Yoga, and you get more time.

548
01:54:45.003 --> 01:54:49.030
Actually, we should have much more time than our ancestors.

549
01:54:49.230 --> 01:54:54.283
You know, we don’t have to go to the jungles to get our wood for our fire,

550
01:54:54.483 --> 01:54:57.730
we don’t have to do all the rest of the things they used to do.

551
01:54:57.930 --> 01:55:00.790
Poor things, they had to go for hunting.

552
01:55:00.990 --> 01:55:07.909
Now we have everything in the house already made, I mean, instant. Isn’t it?

553
01:55:08.110 --> 01:55:12.650
And we have the watch on all of the time watching the watch.

554
01:55:12.850 --> 01:55:16.690
But we have no time. We are the worst.

555
01:55:16.890 --> 01:55:20.049
They had more time than we have.

556
01:55:20.250 --> 01:55:23.470
So where are we spending the time?

557
01:55:23.670 --> 01:55:27.357
While coming here, I just asked him, “What do they make?”

558
01:55:27.557 --> 01:55:31.590
Because I was seeing all Chinese things, Japanese things,

559
01:55:31.790 --> 01:55:36.717
and then I saw lots of Greek,

560
01:55:36.917 --> 01:55:40.240
and most of them were Italian things in the market, shops.

561
01:55:40.440 --> 01:55:42.480
I said, “What do the Australians make?”

562
01:55:42.681 --> 01:55:45.409
He said, “They make lager.”

563
01:55:45.610 --> 01:55:51.883
Where do we spend our time? In the ballroom dancing? Or in the lager?

564
01:55:52.083 --> 01:55:55.257
Or in some way destroying ourselves with drugs or something like that?

565
01:55:55.457 --> 01:55:58.930
We have no time, we have time for drugs, all right.

566
01:55:59.130 --> 01:56:05.210
Then parties, some formal things which have no meaning at all.

567
01:56:05.410 --> 01:56:08.803
It conveys nothing. I have been now in London in a position

568
01:56:09.003 --> 01:56:11.957
where I had to shake hands with six to seven hundred people.

569
01:56:12.157 --> 01:56:17.143
And only I remember the horrible things that happen to the hand,

570
01:56:17.343 --> 01:56:21.843
otherwise I don’t remember even the faces of the people.

571
01:56:24.143 --> 01:56:26.703
So, there should be a better method

572
01:56:26.904 --> 01:56:29.402
of developing a rapport between us,

573
01:56:29.603 --> 01:56:32.750
understanding each other in much more natural way.

574
01:56:32.950 --> 01:56:37.150
And then we have time, this is the time to enjoy.

575
01:56:37.350 --> 01:56:41.103
But nobody enjoys because we are so time bound,

576
01:56:41.303 --> 01:56:46.077
we are so time bound. Only time to enjoy we don’t have.

577
01:56:46.277 --> 01:56:51.503
And that’s how whatever you people say about sleeping or waking up

578
01:56:51.703 --> 01:56:57.250
and all that is that your regulation doesn’t come from the Divine.

579
01:56:57.450 --> 01:57:03.350
If it is from the Divine, you just enjoy,

580
01:57:03.550 --> 01:57:06.883
you just enjoy your life, you enjoy yourself.

581
01:57:07.083 --> 01:57:11.797
Never feel ill or sick. And now I am sixty-seven,

582
01:57:11.997 --> 01:57:15.170
every day I’m giving lectures, morning, evening.

583
01:57:15.370 --> 01:57:18.910
And the smokes, the way people smoke, women,

584
01:57:19.111 --> 01:57:21.631
especially in Australia, I don’t know what has gone wrong with them,

585
01:57:21.832 --> 01:57:24.919
I try to go with the women, so that I’ll be saved from smoking,

586
01:57:25.120 --> 01:57:29.298
they smoke more than the men even here.

587
01:57:30.629 --> 01:57:33.683
So, I’ve developed a throat trouble, I hope it will be all right.

588
01:57:33.883 --> 01:57:39.636
But this is what happens. Where do we spend our time?

589
01:57:40.803 --> 01:57:43.823
There then you are beyond time,

590
01:57:44.023 --> 01:57:49.923
into the timeless dimension enjoying yourself.

591
01:57:50.450 --> 01:57:56.243
That’s the beauty we have to achieve; that state we have to reach.

592
01:57:56.970 --> 01:57:59.896
All right?

593
01:58:00.597 --> 01:58:02.190
What is it?

594
01:58:02.390 --> 01:58:06.137
[He says, my revered father has been for the past three or four years

595
01:58:06.337 --> 01:58:09.390
experiencing astral sounds,

596
01:58:09.590 --> 01:58:14.200
but physically his hearing is impaired

597
01:58:14.400 --> 01:58:18.037
or cut off for all practical purposes.

598
01:58:18.237 --> 01:58:21.343
Twenty-four hours a day he is able to tune into

599
01:58:21.543 --> 01:58:25.130
the chanting of sacred Hindu hymns, devotional music

600
01:58:25.330 --> 01:58:30.303
rendered by an enchanting voice that accompanied by a violin, etcetera.

601
01:58:30.503 --> 01:58:36.177
He has done no special tapas or meditation, but he is very naïve

602
01:58:36.377 --> 01:58:39.837
and a simple soul. Is it because of the awakening of the Kundalini?]

603
01:58:40.037 --> 01:58:43.037
No, not at all.

604
01:58:43.237 --> 01:58:48.417
Not at all. All these things should not happen to you.

605
01:58:48.617 --> 01:58:53.557
You don’t hear anything, you don’t see anything, you become,

606
01:58:53.757 --> 01:58:57.877
you just become.

607
01:58:58.963 --> 01:59:02.537
This is a subject which has to be dealt with clearly

608
01:59:02.737 --> 01:59:06.123
about the dead souls and things, it’s quite a big subject.

609
01:59:06.323 --> 01:59:08.603
But if you come to Sahaja Yoga, you’ll understand what happens,

610
01:59:08.803 --> 01:59:12.630
how you hear these things and how astral things happen,

611
01:59:12.831 --> 01:59:17.636
how your cot deaths take place. All these are all negative things

612
01:59:17.837 --> 01:59:26.977
and are achieved by people who deal in the science of the dead.

613
01:59:27.177 --> 01:59:33.983
Which is very important that you should get out of all these ideas

614
01:59:34.183 --> 01:59:36.657
and become your Self.

615
01:59:36.857 --> 01:59:41.363
Only way to know if a person is Realised is not,

616
01:59:41.563 --> 01:59:46.863
the way he can handle the Kundalini,

617
01:59:47.063 --> 01:59:49.856
the way he can feel the vibrations,

618
01:59:50.057 --> 01:59:53.189
and the way he leads his own life.

619
01:59:53.390 --> 01:59:56.336
When you go to any guru, first of all see the disciples,

620
01:59:56.537 --> 02:00:02.177
how they are, how they behave, what powers they have got.

621
02:00:02.377 --> 02:00:07.090
Then you accept. That’s the sign of a satguru.

622
02:00:07.290 --> 02:00:12.043
Nanaka has said clearly. Guru Nanak was such an enlightened soul

623
02:00:12.243 --> 02:00:17.217
and he said that, “The one who meets you, meet God, is the satguru.”

624
02:00:17.417 --> 02:00:21.410
Everybody is not a guru.

625
02:00:27.156 --> 02:00:31.182
So, should we now have the Realisation?

626
02:00:42.570 --> 02:00:46.603
[Hindi]

627
02:01:40.370 --> 02:01:43.903
That’s for only Indians.

628
02:01:44.103 --> 02:01:48.050
Indians abroad.

629
02:01:53.197 --> 02:01:57.463
Now should we now finish that?

630
02:02:01.337 --> 02:02:04.695
Can we take out our shoes?

631
02:02:04.896 --> 02:02:09.997
Because we have to take the help of the Mother Earth.

632
02:02:15.816 --> 02:02:19.517
As I’ve told you, it cannot be forced.

633
02:02:19.717 --> 02:02:26.416
I respect your freedom, respect your freedom. It’s your free will.

634
02:02:26.616 --> 02:02:29.097
If you want to have your Realisation only you can have,

635
02:02:29.297 --> 02:02:34.557
otherwise you cannot. It cannot be forced on you.

636
02:02:35.297 --> 02:02:39.703
So those who do not want should leave the hall

637
02:02:39.903 --> 02:02:43.230
to be civil to other people.

638
02:02:43.430 --> 02:02:46.941
Otherwise you are welcome.

639
02:02:47.142 --> 02:02:50.930
There are two conditions in Sahaja Yoga,

640
02:02:51.130 --> 02:02:54.017
at least when you are getting your Realisation.

641
02:02:54.217 --> 02:03:00.357
First is to forget your past, to forgive yourself.

642
02:03:00.557 --> 02:03:04.643
You should be pleasantly placed towards yourself,

643
02:03:04.843 --> 02:03:09.083
pleasantly placed towards yourself.

644
02:03:09.283 --> 02:03:21.142
And second one is that you have to forgive everyone.

645
02:03:21.343 --> 02:03:25.037
As I told you yesterday, whether you forgive or don’t forgive,

646
02:03:25.237 --> 02:03:28.717
you don’t do anything. Actually, if you don’t forgive,

647
02:03:28.917 --> 02:03:33.183
then you play into wrong hands. So just neglect it, completely.

648
02:03:33.383 --> 02:03:36.403
Don’t worry about it. And in general, you should say,

649
02:03:36.603 --> 02:03:41.870
“I forgive everyone.” Just say in general, “I forgive everyone.”

650
02:03:42.070 --> 02:03:45.637
That’s all.

651
02:03:47.783 --> 02:03:50.250
Not to count how many people you have to forgive,

652
02:03:50.450 --> 02:03:53.297
not to know about everyone, what they have said to you,

653
02:03:53.497 --> 02:03:56.457
but just forgive in general. That’s all.

654
02:03:56.657 --> 02:03:59.263
So, the first one is to forget your past.

655
02:03:59.463 --> 02:04:01.902
That means not to feel guilty at all.

656
02:04:02.103 --> 02:04:06.343
You’re not to feel guilty. After all, you are a human being

657
02:04:06.543 --> 02:04:11.617
and human beings can only commit mistakes. You’re not gods.

658
02:04:11.817 --> 02:04:14.157
So, what does it matter?

659
02:04:14.357 --> 02:04:18.337
There’s nothing to bother you on that point, should not.

660
02:04:18.537 --> 02:04:22.197
So please forgive yourself and forgive others.

661
02:04:22.398 --> 02:04:25.389
That’s very important.

662
02:04:25.590 --> 02:04:32.803
These are the two simple conditions. But mentally, you should accept them.

663
02:04:33.556 --> 02:04:37.736
Now, we have to put both our feet little away from each other,

664
02:04:37.937 --> 02:04:42.543
because you know there are two powers within us, left and right.

665
02:04:42.743 --> 02:04:46.737
And we use our left hand symbolically to suggest

666
02:04:46.937 --> 02:04:50.937
that we want our Self Realisation and this is the power of desire,

667
02:04:51.137 --> 02:04:53.830
not of Pure Desire, but desire.

668
02:04:54.031 --> 02:04:56.877
And we use our right hand which is the power of action

669
02:04:57.077 --> 02:04:59.690
to nourish our centres on the left-hand side.

670
02:04:59.890 --> 02:05:04.376
We’ll be nourishing our left-hand centres only.

671
02:05:08.650 --> 02:05:10.657
So now you please put your left hand,

672
02:05:10.857 --> 02:05:16.590
comfortably the way you want to put it, it will hardly take ten minutes,

673
02:05:16.790 --> 02:05:21.643
and use your right hand, as I show you now

674
02:05:21.843 --> 02:05:24.828
and then we have to close our eyes.

675
02:05:25.029 --> 02:05:28.057
First, put it on your heart.

676
02:05:28.257 --> 02:05:32.403
This is the centre where resides the Spirit,

677
02:05:32.603 --> 02:05:37.302
so is a very important centre.

678
02:05:37.503 --> 02:05:41.696
Then you take down your right hand in the upper portion

679
02:05:41.897 --> 02:05:47.222
of your abdomen on the left-hand side which is the centre of your mastery

680
02:05:47.423 --> 02:05:52.070
created by great masters.

681
02:05:53.463 --> 02:05:55.990
Now take down your right hand again

682
02:05:56.190 --> 02:05:59.983
to the lower portion of your abdomen.

683
02:06:00.183 --> 02:06:02.997
It is the centre –

684
02:06:03.197 --> 02:06:05.550
I hope you can see it, just come forward a little bit if you don’t mind –

685
02:06:05.751 --> 02:06:09.076
please, thank you.

686
02:06:09.277 --> 02:06:13.683
This is the centre of Pure Knowledge, Pure Knowledge

687
02:06:13.883 --> 02:06:18.350
that acts on your central nervous system.

688
02:06:19.930 --> 02:06:23.130
Then you raise again your hand up

689
02:06:23.337 --> 02:06:25.590
on to the upper portion of your abdomen on the left-hand side,

690
02:06:25.790 --> 02:06:30.697
press it hard. Then, on to your heart.

691
02:06:30.897 --> 02:06:35.270
Then into the corner of your neck and your head.

692
02:06:35.470 --> 02:06:41.462
Press it as back as possible and turn your head to your right.

693
02:06:41.663 --> 02:06:46.742
This centre you catch when you feel guilty.

694
02:06:49.976 --> 02:06:55.248
Now you take your hand and put it on your forehead.

695
02:06:55.449 --> 02:07:00.505
And put down your head on it, press it hard.

696
02:07:05.063 --> 02:07:09.203
This is the centre to forgive others.

697
02:07:09.403 --> 02:07:13.170
Take your right hand on the back side of your head

698
02:07:13.370 --> 02:07:24.557
and please raise your head towards the sky.

699
02:07:28.397 --> 02:07:35.890
This is the centre to ask for forgiveness from Divine without feeling guilty.

700
02:07:36.090 --> 02:07:39.777
Then stretch your palm.

701
02:07:39.977 --> 02:07:45.437
Put the centre of your palm on top of the fontanel bone area

702
02:07:45.637 --> 02:07:49.923
which was a soft bone in your childhood.

703
02:07:50.123 --> 02:07:51.936
Bend your head.

704
02:07:52.137 --> 02:07:59.023
Now, stretch your fingers outward,

705
02:07:59.223 --> 02:08:04.410
outward as much as you can, put a pressure on your scalp,

706
02:08:04.610 --> 02:08:09.663
and move your scalp clockwise.

707
02:08:13.923 --> 02:08:19.203
Seven times very slowly.

708
02:08:38.317 --> 02:08:43.117
Now, that’s all we have to do.

709
02:08:46.323 --> 02:08:49.822
Now you can close your eyes, put your left hand towards Me.

710
02:08:50.023 --> 02:08:52.215
Be careful, you keep your feet apart.

711
02:08:52.416 --> 02:08:57.317
Those who are sitting on the ground are all right.

712
02:08:58.377 --> 02:09:02.183
And now close your eyes. You can take out your spectacles if you want to,

713
02:09:02.383 --> 02:09:07.863
because don’t have to open the eyes till I tell you.

714
02:09:22.343 --> 02:09:28.163
Now, please put your left hand towards Me,

715
02:09:28.363 --> 02:09:36.916
and right hand on your heart.

716
02:09:37.117 --> 02:09:42.617
Now close your eyes. Please don’t open them till I tell you.

717
02:09:51.450 --> 02:09:53.640
Here you have to ask Me a question,

718
02:09:53.841 --> 02:09:56.549
a very important question.

719
02:09:56.750 --> 02:09:59.823
You can call me “Mother” or you can call Me “Shri Mataji”,

720
02:10:00.023 --> 02:10:04.883
whatever you like, very important question.

721
02:10:11.930 --> 02:10:17.343
Ask a question three times in your heart, not loudly, please:

722
02:10:17.543 --> 02:10:20.857
“Mother, am I the Spirit?”

723
02:10:21.057 --> 02:10:28.137
“Mother, am I the Spirit?” Ask this question three times.

724
02:10:33.283 --> 02:10:37.043
If you are the Spirit,

725
02:10:37.243 --> 02:10:45.423
you are your own guide, you are your own master.

726
02:10:46.390 --> 02:10:50.443
So now please bring down your hand, right hand,

727
02:10:50.643 --> 02:10:53.070
in the upper portion of your abdomen on the left-hand side,

728
02:10:53.270 --> 02:10:57.803
press it hard, and here, ask another question three times,

729
02:10:58.003 --> 02:11:02.010
“Mother, am I my own master?”

730
02:11:02.210 --> 02:11:08.263
Ask this question three times: “Mother, am I my own master?”

731
02:11:24.010 --> 02:11:31.463
Now, as I told you, I respect your freedom,

732
02:11:31.663 --> 02:11:34.006
and you have a free will.

733
02:11:34.207 --> 02:11:39.467
I cannot force Pure Knowledge on you, it cannot be.

734
02:11:39.667 --> 02:11:43.003
You have to ask for it. So now take your right hand

735
02:11:43.203 --> 02:11:49.803
in the lower portion of your abdomen on the left-hand side

736
02:11:50.003 --> 02:11:56.557
and ask Me,

737
02:11:56.757 --> 02:12:02.164
“Mother, please give me Pure Knowledge.”

738
02:12:02.503 --> 02:12:08.203
Six times, because this centre has got six petals.

739
02:12:08.403 --> 02:12:13.030
“Mother, please give me Pure Knowledge.

740
02:12:22.083 --> 02:12:29.403
As soon as you ask this question, the Kundalini starts moving upward.

741
02:12:30.497 --> 02:12:33.990
So now we have to nourish the upper centres

742
02:12:34.190 --> 02:12:40.577
to make Its movement, Her movement, faster.

743
02:12:42.523 --> 02:12:46.310
So please raise your right hand

744
02:12:46.510 --> 02:12:50.430
on the upper portion of your abdomen on the left-hand side,

745
02:12:50.630 --> 02:12:55.003
press it hard and here you say with full confidence,

746
02:12:55.203 --> 02:13:06.610
with full confidence you say, “Mother, I am my own master.”

747
02:13:06.810 --> 02:13:13.630
Please say it ten times, “Mother, I am my own master.”

748
02:13:18.770 --> 02:13:23.273
These things remove your conditionings

749
02:13:23.474 --> 02:13:28.353
from wrong teachings.

750
02:13:32.790 --> 02:13:40.437
Now you raise your hand,

751
02:13:40.637 --> 02:13:48.917
the most important question

752
02:13:49.117 --> 02:14:05.490
that is you are not your body, you are not your intelligence,

753
02:14:05.690 --> 02:14:12.597
you’re not your emotions, you are not your conditionings, your ego,

754
02:14:12.797 --> 02:14:17.404
your thoughts, but you are pure Spirit.

755
02:14:22.190 --> 02:14:28.077
So, raise your right hand on to your heart

756
02:14:28.277 --> 02:14:34.250
and say with full confidence twelve times,

757
02:14:34.450 --> 02:14:40.250
full confidence please, “Mother, I am the Spirit.”

758
02:14:40.450 --> 02:14:47.383
Just say that, “Mother, I am the Spirit.” Please say it twelve times.

759
02:15:04.870 --> 02:15:11.397
Now, raise your right hand

760
02:15:11.597 --> 02:15:16.250
to another very important area within us

761
02:15:16.450 --> 02:15:19.377
where, by feeling guilty all the time,

762
02:15:19.577 --> 02:15:24.363
we have harmed a very important centre.

763
02:15:24.563 --> 02:15:29.570
I have to tell you that the Divine Power

764
02:15:29.770 --> 02:15:35.550
is the Ocean of Knowledge and Love.

765
02:15:35.750 --> 02:15:41.177
It is the Ocean of Bliss and Joy.

766
02:15:41.377 --> 02:15:49.997
But above all, above all it is the Ocean of Forgiveness,

767
02:15:50.197 --> 02:15:54.050
and whatever mistakes or wrongs you have done

768
02:15:54.250 --> 02:15:59.250
are dissolved by the power of forgiveness.

769
02:15:59.450 --> 02:16:01.397
So, raise your right hand

770
02:16:01.597 --> 02:16:07.370
into the corner of your neck and your shoulder

771
02:16:07.570 --> 02:16:12.690
and turn your head to your right.

772
02:16:13.737 --> 02:16:20.510
Here you have to say with full confidence sixteen times,

773
02:16:20.710 --> 02:16:23.937
“Mother, I’m not guilty at all.”

774
02:16:24.137 --> 02:16:29.210
Again, you say, “Mother, I am not guilty at all.”

775
02:16:31.150 --> 02:16:35.476
Sixteen times.

776
02:16:38.930 --> 02:16:47.610
I’ve already told you whether you forgive others or not,

777
02:16:47.810 --> 02:16:50.550
you’re not doing anything, it is a myth.

778
02:16:50.750 --> 02:16:53.783
But if you don’t forgive others,

779
02:16:53.983 --> 02:17:08.870
then you fall into the wrong hands and torture yourself for nothing.

780
02:17:09.363 --> 02:17:14.437
So now, please raise your right hand onto your forehead across,

781
02:17:14.637 --> 02:17:17.090
press it hard on both the sides

782
02:17:17.290 --> 02:17:20.443
and put down your head as far as possible,

783
02:17:20.643 --> 02:17:26.377
resting on your hand, and press it on both the sides.

784
02:17:26.577 --> 02:17:29.537
This is the centre where you have to forgive,

785
02:17:29.737 --> 02:17:34.364
forgive others, forgive others.

786
02:17:45.757 --> 02:17:48.817
Just say, “Mother, I forgive everyone.”

787
02:17:49.017 --> 02:17:52.943
Without thinking about them

788
02:17:53.143 --> 02:17:57.120
or thinking about what they have done to you, just say in general,

789
02:17:57.320 --> 02:18:01.777
“Mother, I forgive everyone.”

790
02:18:12.617 --> 02:18:21.343
Now, how many times is not the point, from your heart.

791
02:18:21.543 --> 02:18:24.757
You must say it properly. Yesterday so many didn’t say

792
02:18:24.957 --> 02:18:28.543
and I had to work very hard on them. So please say it,

793
02:18:28.743 --> 02:18:35.070
please say it from your heart once for all, “Mother, I forgive everyone.”

794
02:18:43.790 --> 02:18:47.137
Now take back your hand on the back side of your head,

795
02:18:47.337 --> 02:18:53.117
on the optic globe and now raise it higher

796
02:18:53.317 --> 02:19:03.957
and let it rest on your hand.

797
02:19:04.643 --> 02:19:16.443
Here you have to say for your own satisfaction,

798
02:19:16.643 --> 02:19:20.643
not feeling guilty, not counting your mistakes,

799
02:19:20.843 --> 02:19:27.056
“Oh Divine Power, if I have done any mistakes, please forgive me.”

800
02:19:28.663 --> 02:19:33.716
Say it from your heart.

801
02:19:40.677 --> 02:19:44.237
Now,

802
02:19:44.438 --> 02:19:50.216
stretch your palm, keeping your left hand towards Me.

803
02:19:50.417 --> 02:19:55.323
This is the most important centre. Both the feet apart from each other.

804
02:19:55.523 --> 02:20:00.257
Keep yourself straight and put your right hand,

805
02:20:00.457 --> 02:20:06.117
the centre of your palm, on top of the fontanel bone area,

806
02:20:06.317 --> 02:20:12.668
the soft bone which you had in your childhood, and press it.

807
02:20:12.869 --> 02:20:18.640
Now bend your head as much as you can, press back your fingers,

808
02:20:18.840 --> 02:20:21.323
press back your thumb,

809
02:20:21.523 --> 02:20:25.143
so there’s a pressure on your scalp, nicely pressurised.

810
02:20:25.343 --> 02:20:31.443
Now move it, move it slowly seven times.

811
02:20:31.643 --> 02:20:35.437
Here again I cannot, I’m sorry,

812
02:20:35.637 --> 02:20:40.097
I cannot disrespect your freedom and free will.

813
02:20:40.297 --> 02:20:45.017
You have to ask for your Self Realisation, it cannot be forced on you.

814
02:20:45.217 --> 02:20:49.203
So, seven times, please say seven times,

815
02:20:49.403 --> 02:20:56.483
“Mother, please give me my Self Realisation.” Please say it seven times.

816
02:21:49.897 --> 02:21:54.390
Now please take down your both the hands and open your eyes slowly,

817
02:21:54.590 --> 02:22:00.277
very slowly. Now watch Me without thinking.

818
02:22:00.477 --> 02:22:04.384
You can do it.

819
02:22:05.810 --> 02:22:10.183
Now, put up your right hand like this and bend your head

820
02:22:10.383 --> 02:22:17.096
and see for yourself if there’s a cool breeze coming out of your head.

821
02:22:18.123 --> 02:22:23.910
Bend your head. It is above your head, not on.

822
02:22:24.110 --> 02:22:28.597
So little away from the head, try to feel if there’s a cool breeze

823
02:22:28.797 --> 02:22:34.430
coming out of your head. You can take your hand a little further.

824
02:22:34.630 --> 02:22:39.717
Some people have it quite away from the head.

825
02:22:39.917 --> 02:22:45.097
So, see for yourself if there’s a cool breeze coming out.

826
02:22:46.430 --> 02:22:53.937
Now, put the left hand towards Me and put down your head.

827
02:22:55.423 --> 02:22:59.223
Now see for yourself, again with the right hand,

828
02:22:59.423 --> 02:23:01.797
if there’s a cool breeze coming out of your head.

829
02:23:01.997 --> 02:23:04.777
Some people will get heat coming out, doesn’t matter,

830
02:23:04.977 --> 02:23:08.057
it will later on be followed by cool breeze also.

831
02:23:08.257 --> 02:23:10.503
You see yourself if there is the cool breeze coming.

832
02:23:10.703 --> 02:23:13.810
Bend your head properly, that’s important.

833
02:23:14.010 --> 02:23:18.816
Now, again put your right hand towards Me

834
02:23:19.017 --> 02:23:22.880
and bend your head. Now don’t doubt. The breeze is coming from inside

835
02:23:23.080 --> 02:23:26.437
and not from the air conditioner, so see for yourself.

836
02:23:26.637 --> 02:23:29.683
Again, this is the Cool Breeze of the Holy Ghost,

837
02:23:29.883 --> 02:23:34.363
this Kundalini is the Holy Ghost. Now see.

838
02:23:44.170 --> 02:23:50.117
Now raise your both the hands towards the sky,

839
02:23:50.317 --> 02:23:55.510
push back your head and here you ask a question,

840
02:23:55.710 --> 02:23:59.417
“Mother, is this the Cool Breeze of the Holy Ghost?”

841
02:23:59.617 --> 02:24:03.590
“Mother, is this the All Pervading Power of Divine Love?”

842
02:24:03.790 --> 02:24:08.550
“Mother, is this the Paramchaitanya?” Ask any one of these questions

843
02:24:08.750 --> 02:24:10.723
three times.

844
02:24:10.923 --> 02:24:16.643
Push back your head fully and ask this question.

845
02:24:19.890 --> 02:24:22.543
Separate your hands; don’t put them together.

846
02:24:22.743 --> 02:24:25.483
Separate your hands.

847
02:24:25.683 --> 02:24:29.210
May God bless you. Bring down your hands, please.

848
02:24:29.410 --> 02:24:33.983
You can watch Me without thinking.

849
02:24:34.710 --> 02:24:37.977
Now those who have felt the cool breeze

850
02:24:38.177 --> 02:24:43.603
or even a hot breeze out of their heads or on their fingertips,

851
02:24:43.803 --> 02:24:48.150
please raise both your hands.

852
02:24:51.710 --> 02:24:56.290
The whole of Sydney is drowned into the Ocean of Joy.

853
02:24:56.490 --> 02:25:02.730
May God bless you. So, the Kundalini has sprouted,

854
02:25:02.930 --> 02:25:07.570
Kundalini has come out,

855
02:25:07.770 --> 02:25:13.223
you are connected with That, but you have to establish yourself.

856
02:25:13.423 --> 02:25:17.557
Otherwise it would be like the marshy land

857
02:25:17.757 --> 02:25:21.790
where Christ has described some seeds fell down,

858
02:25:21.990 --> 02:25:25.837
they sprouted and were destroyed.

859
02:25:26.037 --> 02:25:30.690
Must respect our Self Realisation, we must respect ourselves.

860
02:25:30.890 --> 02:25:33.777
Now you have become saints

861
02:25:33.977 --> 02:25:40.120
and you have to understand that it’s a glorious thing

862
02:25:40.320 --> 02:25:47.410
that is happening to you, and you now become the instrument of God.

863
02:25:48.537 --> 02:25:53.757
You can come to the follow-on program,

864
02:25:53.957 --> 02:25:56.777
they have nice courses for you, something.

865
02:25:56.977 --> 02:25:59.350
You don’t have to pay anything, but you have to give some time,

866
02:25:59.550 --> 02:26:04.837
that’s all, and within a month you’ll find you’ll become masters.

867
02:26:05.037 --> 02:26:11.250
Master of yourself and master of this art of yoga.

868
02:26:11.757 --> 02:26:13.757
They’ll answer all your questions.

869
02:26:13.958 --> 02:26:15.949
They’ll see to it that it works out.

870
02:26:16.150 --> 02:26:21.010
Now we have very good, humble people who’ll look after you,

871
02:26:21.210 --> 02:26:25.057
and they have all the knowledge, and you can also get My tapes

872
02:26:25.257 --> 02:26:27.360
and things where I tell you about,

873
02:26:27.560 --> 02:26:31.770
three to four thousand tapes are there only in English language,

874
02:26:31.970 --> 02:26:35.303
and in Hindi, Marathi and that way.

875
02:26:35.503 --> 02:26:38.283
But unless and until you are established, I would not like you

876
02:26:38.484 --> 02:26:41.483
to read books about it, because then again, you’ll get lost.

877
02:26:41.683 --> 02:26:44.190
So, first thing is to establish yourself fully,

878
02:26:44.390 --> 02:26:48.297
so you don’t get lost into your ego, as you were saying,

879
02:26:48.497 --> 02:26:51.497
or into any such trips. Better get established first,

880
02:26:51.697 --> 02:26:56.270
then nothing makes you feel that way.

881
02:26:56.470 --> 02:26:58.470
May God bless you all.

882
02:26:58.671 --> 02:27:06.842
I’ll be coming after one year and I hope all of you will become great trees

883
02:27:07.049 --> 02:27:12.557
giving the beautiful vibrations to this great country of innocence

884
02:27:12.757 --> 02:27:15.303
and changing everyone.

885
02:27:15.503 --> 02:27:19.050
The transformation within you will definitely help to change

886
02:27:19.250 --> 02:27:23.083
so many things in this country and you’ll be amazed

887
02:27:23.283 --> 02:27:27.523
how the planning of the Divine works for you every moment

888
02:27:27.723 --> 02:27:31.023
and how you’re helped and looked after, guided and protected.

889
02:27:31.223 --> 02:27:33.683
It’s very surprising.

890
02:27:33.883 --> 02:27:37.783
May God bless you.

891
02:27:44.210 --> 02:27:46.757
Yesterday I met most of you people.

892
02:27:46.957 --> 02:27:49.300
Those whom I have not met and who have got Realisation,

893
02:27:49.501 --> 02:27:51.760
I would like to meet. It’s already it is ten-thirty.

894
02:27:51.960 --> 02:27:54.887
We had a music program.

895
02:27:55.087 --> 02:27:57.170
But whom I have met is all right.

896
02:27:57.371 --> 02:28:01.410
Those who haven’t got Realisation can come on one side. They can see.

897
02:28:01.611 --> 02:28:03.917
Those whom I have not met and who have got Realisation,

898
02:28:04.117 --> 02:28:08.503
can come and meet Me.

